sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client Browser
    participant SH as SignalR Hub
    participant GS as GameStateMachineService
    participant SN as SignalRNotificationService
    participant GM as GameModel Storage
    participant OC as Other Clients

    Note over C,OC: Player Joining Game Flow
    
    C->>+SH: JoinGame(gameId, playerId)
    Note right of C: Establish WebSocket connection
    
    SH->>+GS: GetCurrentGameState(gameId)
    GS->>+GM: Retrieve game state
    GM-->>-GS: Return GameModel
    GS-->>-SH: Return current state
    
    SH->>SH: Groups.AddToGroupAsync(connectionId, gameId)
    Note right of SH: Add client to game group
    
    SH->>+C: SendAsync("GameStateUpdated", gameModel)
    Note right of SH: Send current state to new client
    
    SH->>+OC: SendAsync("PlayerPresenceChanged", playerId, true)
    Note right of SH: Notify other players
    
    SH-->>-C: JoinGame complete
    
    Note over C,OC: Client Now Ready for Real-time Updates
    
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over C,OC: Ongoing: Real-time Game Updates
        GM->>SN: Game state changes
        SN->>SH: NotifyAsync(gameId, gameModel)
        SH->>C: SendAsync("GameStateUpdated", gameModel)
        SH->>OC: SendAsync("GameStateUpdated", gameModel)
    end